(6457618, 957740, 12611, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure of the point- I mean, the girl is quite attractive and the shot is fine technically- Am I missing the "art"<br/>component? Maybe its the fact she''s staring into the camera. If its a self portrait, that would be another thing- so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. Sorry for the ramble- good luck!</td>', 'I''m really not sure of the point- I mean, the girl is quite attractive and the shot is fine technically- Am I missing the "art"component? Maybe its the fact she''s staring into the camera. If its a self portrait, that would be another thing- so I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. Sorry for the ramble- good luck!', '2011-07-01 09:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6457619, 957407, 12611, '<td valign="top">alabaster skin, hair black as night, blue eyes, my first thought, I''m not sure if I am right, but I thought, Icelandic. Anyhow- you look at the viewer with eyes that look through the viewer- the best part about self portraits.</td>', 'alabaster skin, hair black as night, blue eyes, my first thought, I''m not sure if I am right, but I thought, Icelandic. Anyhow- you look at the viewer with eyes that look through the viewer- the best part about self portraits.', '2011-07-01 09:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6457620, 959612, 12611, '<td valign="top">Staring at this a while, I like the primary colors, the shapes, the overgrown but under-watered summer feel. I like the portrait framing, the way it almost seems like you are walking down the path towards the tennis courts. Perhaps there is no "wow factor" enough to carry you remotely into the top 50, but rest assured this is a good shot and I am glad you entered it.</td>', 'Staring at this a while, I like the primary colors, the shapes, the overgrown but under-watered summer feel. I like the portrait framing, the way it almost seems like you are walking down the path towards the tennis courts. Perhaps there is no "wow factor" enough to carry you remotely into the top 50, but rest assured this is a good shot and I am glad you entered it.', '2011-07-01 09:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6457621, 957530, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but the crop seems a bit too tight and the focus seems a bit on and off- this probably would have been super in black and white.</td>', 'I like the concept, but the crop seems a bit too tight and the focus seems a bit on and off- this probably would have been super in black and white.', '2011-07-01 09:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
