(6457810, 957521, 10785, '<td valign="top">This man ought to be proud of this picture! Nice job. Love the muted feel of the colors and the composition with the flag. One thing... the eyes are very unnatural. No one has Ice blue eyes like that. I think you just worked them too much in PP.</td>', 'This man ought to be proud of this picture! Nice job. Love the muted feel of the colors and the composition with the flag. One thing... the eyes are very unnatural. No one has Ice blue eyes like that. I think you just worked them too much in PP.', '2011-07-01 12:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6457815, 959769, 83845, '<td valign="top">Very attractive photo.  I love the texture!</td>', 'Very attractive photo.  I love the texture!', '2011-07-01 12:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6457816, 959044, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think the photo is very good with a hard edged contrast and deep saturated colors. One thing that could be changed is the background. It is dark and busy with lots of textures that overpower and hide the subject somewhat. I would prefer a more grey urban background or something plain and simple.</td>', 'I think the photo is very good with a hard edged contrast and deep saturated colors. One thing that could be changed is the background. It is dark and busy with lots of textures that overpower and hide the subject somewhat. I would prefer a more grey urban background or something plain and simple.', '2011-07-01 12:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6457817, 957934, 83845, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean, well executed, beautiful shot.</td>', 'Nice, clean, well executed, beautiful shot.', '2011-07-01 12:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6457819, 959049, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s like the entrance to a hobbit hole or something. Very dreamy and good soft focus. I like how you exposed the light to make the entire scene nice and bright without really blowing anything out.</td>', 'It''s like the entrance to a hobbit hole or something. Very dreamy and good soft focus. I like how you exposed the light to make the entire scene nice and bright without really blowing anything out.', '2011-07-01 12:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
