(6459696, 959567, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and I like the way the colors hold this together. If I had to quibble, I''d wish for slightly better (natural) light and maybe a glimpse of the girl''s face.</td>', 'Nicely seen and I like the way the colors hold this together. If I had to quibble, I''d wish for slightly better (natural) light and maybe a glimpse of the girl''s face.', '2011-07-03 12:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
