(6459747, 958685, 39880, '<td valign="top">Good looking girl, check.<br/>Showing the colors on the 4th of July weekend, check.<br/>Sweet location, check.<br/>Great shot, check.<br/> <br/>I don''t think you''ve posted enough of her.  Any more coming?</td>', 'Good looking girl, check.Showing the colors on the 4th of July weekend, check.Sweet location, check.Great shot, check. I don''t think you''ve posted enough of her.  Any more coming?', '2011-07-03 13:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
