(6460223, 958938, 30982, '<td valign="top">Haven''t started voting - just perusing thumbs.  This caught my eye immediately.  I''ll just say "Welcome back, Nick!" (And if it isn''t Nick Hinch''s, take this as a compliment.)</td>', 'Haven''t started voting - just perusing thumbs.  This caught my eye immediately.  I''ll just say "Welcome back, Nick!" (And if it isn''t Nick Hinch''s, take this as a compliment.)', '2011-07-03 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6460369, 959286, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  Has a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24454" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SandyP</a> feel to it.  Love the narrow DOF.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  Has a  SandyP feel to it.  Love the narrow DOF.', '2011-07-04 01:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6460593, 958962, 12405, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot, it isn''t the standard shot we always see .. Rich colors and detail .. Got my attention and want to know more about how this happened etc. Well done.</td>', 'Really like this shot, it isn''t the standard shot we always see .. Rich colors and detail .. Got my attention and want to know more about how this happened etc. Well done.', '2011-07-04 02:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
