(6461283, 956259, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a bicycle trip I took down the Mosel River in Germany back in the early 80''s. We''d camped out overnight and in the morning were treated to a very similar scene as we headed off down the river. <br/> <br/>A blast from the past always gets extra pointage from me.</td>', 'Reminds me of a bicycle trip I took down the Mosel River in Germany back in the early 80''s. We''d camped out overnight and in the morning were treated to a very similar scene as we headed off down the river.  A blast from the past always gets extra pointage from me.', '2011-07-04 19:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461285, 959713, 119667, '<td valign="top">excellent, reminds me of Martin Parr''s style</td>', 'excellent, reminds me of Martin Parr''s style', '2011-07-04 19:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6461291, 959614, 119667, '<td valign="top">lovely shot. impressive tones</td>', 'lovely shot. impressive tones', '2011-07-04 19:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
