(6464105, 958468, 83313, '<td valign="top">How did she get that little woman into her cone?! I''ve seen ice cream with "surprises" inside, but this is taking it a little far. This entry has the distinct flavor of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> style street photography. Mine are getting easy to pick out of a crowd as well.</td>', 'How did she get that little woman into her cone?! I''ve seen ice cream with "surprises" inside, but this is taking it a little far. This entry has the distinct flavor of  bvy style street photography. Mine are getting easy to pick out of a crowd as well.', '2011-07-07 13:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
