(6464222, 958362, 63812, '<td valign="top">nice!</td>', 'nice!', '2011-07-07 15:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464231, 955734, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Stunning, thoughtful composition, great light and an interesting story make this a bit of a stand out for me. I''m really fond of the glow too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I might have been tempted to clone away the cord on the left.<br/> <br/>Overall: Compelling work. And a bit different too. I likw that.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Stunning, thoughtful composition, great light and an interesting story make this a bit of a stand out for me. I''m really fond of the glow too. Critical stuff: I might have been tempted to clone away the cord on the left. Overall: Compelling work. And a bit different too. I likw that.', '2011-07-07 16:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464234, 958508, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: So much to look at here - the clouds, the hill, the city, the water, the statue (?), the puddle, its reflection, those marvellous trails.... the eye is led through this image quite wonderfully. And then we have the great light, the life of the moving figures and a nice bit of grain.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nicely seen and made</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: So much to look at here - the clouds, the hill, the city, the water, the statue (?), the puddle, its reflection, those marvellous trails.... the eye is led through this image quite wonderfully. And then we have the great light, the life of the moving figures and a nice bit of grain. Critical stuff: Nothing really Overall: Very nicely seen and made', '2011-07-07 16:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464236, 959614, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Amazing - I wonder if this is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jagar</a>. The clarity of the buildings down the street is just wonderful, as are the textures of the cobbles. Then there is the figure - what is really special is how the bottom of her dress/robe follows exactly the line of the shadow - it pulled me forward in my seat to try to discern where she began and the shadow finished.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very, very strong work.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Amazing - I wonder if this is a  jagar. The clarity of the buildings down the street is just wonderful, as are the textures of the cobbles. Then there is the figure - what is really special is how the bottom of her dress/robe follows exactly the line of the shadow - it pulled me forward in my seat to try to discern where she began and the shadow finished. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: Very, very strong work.', '2011-07-07 16:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464241, 959713, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Some people will take this as a snapshot. I don''t. This is comedy, authenticity, juxtaposition - the iPod shuffle, the Morrison''s bag, the rubble-like cobbles, the burnt skin, the meditative pose, the stark sunshine, the girls behind, the clipped head. All marvellous.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing.<br/> <br/>Overall: Perfect parody of so much stereotyping. Well done.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Some people will take this as a snapshot. I don''t. This is comedy, authenticity, juxtaposition - the iPod shuffle, the Morrison''s bag, the rubble-like cobbles, the burnt skin, the meditative pose, the stark sunshine, the girls behind, the clipped head. All marvellous. Critical stuff: Nothing. Overall: Perfect parody of so much stereotyping. Well done.', '2011-07-07 16:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464243, 959473, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Very well seen and very well executed. Both the shot and the processing are bang on. You get a really sense of the shininess of the chrome here and the deep blacks of your high contrast processing is excellent. I really like how the two reflections offer two very different versions of the same scene.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I wish the top right corner was completely black.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nice indeed.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Very well seen and very well executed. Both the shot and the processing are bang on. You get a really sense of the shininess of the chrome here and the deep blacks of your high contrast processing is excellent. I really like how the two reflections offer two very different versions of the same scene. Critical stuff: I wish the top right corner was completely black. Overall: Very nice indeed.', '2011-07-07 16:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464246, 959784, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: The boldness of the wooden support column works so well - almost (but importantly not quite) takes the viewer''s attention away from the animal. I really like the blur too (Lensbaby?) and the way the lighting catches the highlights on the underside of the sheep.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I kind of wish the top right corner  was black.<br/> <br/>Overall: Unusual and interesting.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: The boldness of the wooden support column works so well - almost (but importantly not quite) takes the viewer''s attention away from the animal. I really like the blur too (Lensbaby?) and the way the lighting catches the highlights on the underside of the sheep. Critical stuff: I kind of wish the top right corner  was black. Overall: Unusual and interesting.', '2011-07-07 16:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464252, 959664, 63812, '<td valign="top">LOL ..cute!!9</td>', 'LOL ..cute!!9', '2011-07-07 17:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464273, 958508, 50695, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/artpost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery.</td>', '  I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery.', '2011-07-07 17:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464277, 958124, 86799, '<td valign="top">Like this a lot.  Curves and angles, smooth and textured, simple and stark.  Good work.</td>', 'Like this a lot.  Curves and angles, smooth and textured, simple and stark.  Good work.', '2011-07-07 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464317, 957900, 108580, '<td valign="top">Stunning work, NG would be interested :)</td>', 'Stunning work, NG would be interested :)', '2011-07-07 18:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464323, 959601, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Lovely colours and nice vignette. I really like the city on the horizon and the wedge shaped ocean. Obviously the figure is the focus of the frame and certainly she makes for an intriguing story - possibly involving murder.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I do like the image but for me there something that is a bit misaligned.<br/> <br/>Overall: Imaginative and well done.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Lovely colours and nice vignette. I really like the city on the horizon and the wedge shaped ocean. Obviously the figure is the focus of the frame and certainly she makes for an intriguing story - possibly involving murder. Critical stuff: I do like the image but for me there something that is a bit misaligned. Overall: Imaginative and well done.', '2011-07-07 18:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464326, 957603, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What an extraordinary image - a self portrait for sure but you aren''t the focus here. The latent menace of your main subject is highly compelling. The reflection makes for a wonderful low contrast rendition. I love the reflected scenery too - especially the train.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: Excellent image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What an extraordinary image - a self portrait for sure but you aren''t the focus here. The latent menace of your main subject is highly compelling. The reflection makes for a wonderful low contrast rendition. I love the reflected scenery too - especially the train. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: Excellent image.', '2011-07-07 18:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464329, 959711, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I''m a fan of good model shots and this is fabulous. The DOF is just perfect, as is the overall composition. I love the light and your model is lovely. These colours should be garish and over-powering but instead it all hangs together really well.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing.<br/> <br/>Overall: Wonderful stuff.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I''m a fan of good model shots and this is fabulous. The DOF is just perfect, as is the overall composition. I love the light and your model is lovely. These colours should be garish and over-powering but instead it all hangs together really well. Critical stuff: Nothing. Overall: Wonderful stuff.', '2011-07-07 18:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464332, 959493, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is a very powerful image - the foreground blurred object resonating with your title as it does. The face communicates much and the light has exactly the right balance of harsh and soft elements. Monochrome was a good choice here too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Perhaps the POV could be a tiny bit higher.<br/> <br/>Overall: Compelling.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is a very powerful image - the foreground blurred object resonating with your title as it does. The face communicates much and the light has exactly the right balance of harsh and soft elements. Monochrome was a good choice here too. Critical stuff: Perhaps the POV could be a tiny bit higher. Overall: Compelling.', '2011-07-07 18:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464334, 959648, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Beautifully composed image - that diagonal shadow running corner to corner is tremendous. The light on the building is pretty special and the figure brings the whole scene to life.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: There seems to be some slight haloing around the figure.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very strong work</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Beautifully composed image - that diagonal shadow running corner to corner is tremendous. The light on the building is pretty special and the figure brings the whole scene to life. Critical stuff: There seems to be some slight haloing around the figure. Overall: Very strong work', '2011-07-07 18:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464337, 958938, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Amazing use of negative space - so much captured in so little of the frame. I believe this could only work in monochrome and your choice of toning and curves is bang on.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing at all.<br/> <br/>Overall: Amazing work</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Amazing use of negative space - so much captured in so little of the frame. I believe this could only work in monochrome and your choice of toning and curves is bang on. Critical stuff: Nothing at all. Overall: Amazing work', '2011-07-07 18:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464340, 954929, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like how this image teases the viewer - it is on the brink of clarity, on the threshold of illumination with a story that only just forms in our mind.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I do like the grain but the cross-hatch artefacting is distracting.<br/> <br/>Overall: Imaginative and interesting.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like how this image teases the viewer - it is on the brink of clarity, on the threshold of illumination with a story that only just forms in our mind. Critical stuff: I do like the grain but the cross-hatch artefacting is distracting. Overall: Imaginative and interesting.', '2011-07-07 18:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464348, 956455, 108580, '<td valign="top">You again :) Man I can''t wait to find out your behind the scenes. That duo tone BG never mind the s/s, wing flare, super sharp head and feet...</td>', 'You again :) Man I can''t wait to find out your behind the scenes. That duo tone BG never mind the s/s, wing flare, super sharp head and feet...', '2011-07-07 19:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464357, 958796, 108580, '<td valign="top">Hello Paul, need someone to hold your reflectors? Super work mate. I have to re-floor my studio...I''m electing to go with old knotty pine...</td>', 'Hello Paul, need someone to hold your reflectors? Super work mate. I have to re-floor my studio...I''m electing to go with old knotty pine...', '2011-07-07 19:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6464364, 959839, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice new take on an old theme. Superbly represented however. In the top20 in a FS at least, maybe top10.</td>', 'Nice new take on an old theme. Superbly represented however. In the top20 in a FS at least, maybe top10.', '2011-07-07 19:13:05.000000', NULL, 1);
