(6464370, 954929, 76335, '<td valign="top">Must be JM. And I must bump this a point or two. I love the biting wit of your title. Love is a battlefield.</td>', 'Must be JM. And I must bump this a point or two. I love the biting wit of your title. Love is a battlefield.', '2011-07-07 19:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
