(6464395, 955734, 76335, '<td valign="top">I was initially put off by the brand newness of the clipboard (with label). But I tend to think that means the scene is as you found it, which I appreciate more than a set up moment. Nice.</td>', 'I was initially put off by the brand newness of the clipboard (with label). But I tend to think that means the scene is as you found it, which I appreciate more than a set up moment. Nice.', '2011-07-07 19:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
