(6464400, 958607, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love uninhabited garden shots. The best ones have more life than a rock concert. This is good. The way the four foreground elements are situated, individually and collectively, is most smart. Lots of gravity here. Energy. Silent voices. Nice.</td>', 'I love uninhabited garden shots. The best ones have more life than a rock concert. This is good. The way the four foreground elements are situated, individually and collectively, is most smart. Lots of gravity here. Energy. Silent voices. Nice.', '2011-07-07 19:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
