(6464614, 958190, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and bright red chairs on all that green.  Horizon feels a little off-kilter and exposure looks very dark on the tree and a little too light in comparison on the background trees and sky.  I might have tried shooting with a graduated neutral density filter, shooting several bracketed exposures, and/or processing with some HDR/tonemapping to get the exposure evened out.</td>', 'Like the composition and bright red chairs on all that green.  Horizon feels a little off-kilter and exposure looks very dark on the tree and a little too light in comparison on the background trees and sky.  I might have tried shooting with a graduated neutral density filter, shooting several bracketed exposures, and/or processing with some HDR/tonemapping to get the exposure evened out.', '2011-07-07 23:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
