(6464856, 958129, 29777, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m disappointed to see this was not more widely appreciated. It was my only 10 in the challenge. You perfectly captured and conveyed an important event in your life and your son''s. This one should be framed and placed prominently on your wall. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you very much for the kind words and the score. I really appreciate your work on this site and I am flattered by your comments. I hope my skills improve to your level.<br/> <br/>I felt this shot had all the elements of a good story. From the foreground, to the sidewalk leading to my son on the bike, to the house and car in the background. I love this shot for many reasons and it will be framed and displayed proudly in the house.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: I''m disappointed to see this was not more widely appreciated. It was my only 10 in the challenge. You perfectly captured and conveyed an important event in your life and your son''s. This one should be framed and placed prominently on your wall.   Thank you very much for the kind words and the score. I really appreciate your work on this site and I am flattered by your comments. I hope my skills improve to your level. I felt this shot had all the elements of a good story. From the foreground, to the sidewalk leading to my son on the bike, to the house and car in the background. I love this shot for many reasons and it will be framed and displayed proudly in the house.', '2011-07-08 01:50:41.000000', NULL, 0),
