(6466230, 959839, 119823, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by reneekerr:</b></div><hr/><i> Love this photo, and am amazed at seeing the voting breakdown that you actually received low scores..mind boggling.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Renee, you are right, I just browse the voting breakdowns of all top tens and found the low scores concentrate on this photo. very strange! the voting system is anonymous to all paid members, how can this happen? mind boggling too.</td>', 'Originally posted by reneekerr: Love this photo, and am amazed at seeing the voting breakdown that you actually received low scores..mind boggling. Congrats on the ribbon!   Renee, you are right, I just browse the voting breakdowns of all top tens and found the low scores concentrate on this photo. very strange! the voting system is anonymous to all paid members, how can this happen? mind boggling too.', '2011-07-09 11:37:29.000000', NULL, 0),
