(6466863, 959056, 98022, '<td valign="top">Outstanding shot! I am amazed at this capture. From my experience, photographing dragonflys is extremely difficult. Congrats on the blue! Well deserved!</td>', 'Outstanding shot! I am amazed at this capture. From my experience, photographing dragonflys is extremely difficult. Congrats on the blue! Well deserved!', '2011-07-10 11:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466869, 959745, 67697, '<td valign="top">Were you surrounded by mist or a cloud while taking this shot?  It''s prettty fascinating.  I like how the light leads the eye out of the fog and into the clearing.</td>', 'Were you surrounded by mist or a cloud while taking this shot?  It''s prettty fascinating.  I like how the light leads the eye out of the fog and into the clearing.', '2011-07-10 12:07:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6466871, 959377, 67697, '<td valign="top">I wish the perspective included more of the sky.  It''s gorgeous.  I think all the textures of the rock compete with it.  Is that a road down there on the right?  That acts as a nice reference for how high you were when taking this shot.</td>', 'I wish the perspective included more of the sky.  It''s gorgeous.  I think all the textures of the rock compete with it.  Is that a road down there on the right?  That acts as a nice reference for how high you were when taking this shot.', '2011-07-10 12:09:42.000000', NULL, 0),
