(6468080, 958796, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful piece of art.  I have been visiting it and thinking about it since I saw it mentioned in the 1x thread.  Exquisite use of light and form.  It does, in a way, make me a bit sad on a personal level.  Not only could I most likely never "see" how to shoot something like this, but I also realized (after watching too many episodes of a silly TV show) that the beauty of the model is integral to art like this.  A shot like this, no matter how expertly lit or framed, would never see the light of day with someone like me as the model.  Very selfish and silly, I know.  :-)  But it does make me envious, not just of your skill but of her light.  She truly is gorgeous and you''ve done well by her.</td>', 'This is a beautiful piece of art.  I have been visiting it and thinking about it since I saw it mentioned in the 1x thread.  Exquisite use of light and form.  It does, in a way, make me a bit sad on a personal level.  Not only could I most likely never "see" how to shoot something like this, but I also realized (after watching too many episodes of a silly TV show) that the beauty of the model is integral to art like this.  A shot like this, no matter how expertly lit or framed, would never see the light of day with someone like me as the model.  Very selfish and silly, I know.  :-)  But it does make me envious, not just of your skill but of her light.  She truly is gorgeous and you''ve done well by her.', '2011-07-11 21:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6468176, 958796, 54645, '<td valign="top">What gorgeous light. Masterful composition, and I particularly like the the hair wrapping around her wrist. Gives it a very subtle sense of serenity, likely the source of her ability to melt into the lens.</td>', 'What gorgeous light. Masterful composition, and I particularly like the the hair wrapping around her wrist. Gives it a very subtle sense of serenity, likely the source of her ability to melt into the lens.', '2011-07-12 01:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
