(6626461, 957929, 97225, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful, beautifully processed shot of this fascinating sculpture. Thanks for including the link, which was very interesting and informative (but not as well photographed.)</td>', 'This is a wonderful, beautifully processed shot of this fascinating sculpture. Thanks for including the link, which was very interesting and informative (but not as well photographed.)', '2011-12-27 18:07:06.000000', NULL, 0),
